{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not synchronously wait behind cleanup after observing a JVM fatal.** After recording a `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, the loop still invokes every remaining end hook; if one blocks, the fatal never reaches the invocation caller. Publish or rethrow JVM-fatal failures immediately and make remaining cleanup bounded and best-effort; add a fatal-plus-blocked-hook regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77SFRN","finding_digest":"c92b7c1747a290739ec238dd4ec3ebca21a44760e63e5f5597374768eeaf7d5f","finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","line":116,"observation_digest":"e31eebec2c68a3c0589b6a04a4b8dde045173e7e8f041dc167fb418f52bf1ee7","observation_id":"aro_v1_4mpox3bmncr4awe3nickjog54b","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","published_at":"2026-10-08T06:50:35Z","review_id":"arr_v1_oku3igfk3ygjtbpxj7vr4crtuk","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2df3d686638d1451d0c62cd2678c16968f3482f4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":113,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_aiw6rzjvyjyoo5tiszbgr7q6aw","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T06:50:35Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
